Package: ete
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.8), python3-curses
Description: ECHO terminal text editor
 ETE is a lightweight terminal text editor with familiar GUI-editor shortcuts.
 It includes syntax highlighting, line numbers, mouse selection, undo/redo,
 find and replace, automatic indentation, and word wrap.
